OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry opens into rejected plan
OL,4,Afor housing estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry has been opened to
OL,7,Fexamine a local authority's decision to
OL,8,Freject plans for a housing estate.
OL,10,FHousing provider Bromford Flagship
OL,11,FLiveWest (BFL) proposed a #250m plan to
OL,12,Fdemolish and rebuild half of the 1,100
OL,13,Fproperties on the Abbey Estate in
OL,14,FThetford, Norfolk, and add 500 homes.
OL,16,FBreckland Council refused the
OL,17,Fapplication, which would have created
OL,18,Fnew energy-efficient properties, last
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
