OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry opens into rejected plan
OL,4,Afor housing estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry, which is being held in
OL,7,FDereham, will hear evidence over the
OL,8,Fnext five days, before the Planning
OL,9,FInspectorate makes its final decision
OL,10,Fexpected next year.
